{"4367760":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Ice is Watching","steam_appid":4367760,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUT NOW<\/strong>  |  Single-player  |  About 2 hours  |  First-person psychological horror<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ice is Watching<\/strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience that plunges you into a desolate, frozen nightmare. You don't play as a hero. You play as a desperate woman driven by a single question: <i>Where is he?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracing your lover's last known location to a remote mountain cabin, the temperature drops and a chilling realization sets in: you are not alone. A looming figure known only as &quot;The Ice&quot; is here. And he's been expecting you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK THE CYCLE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in the artificial warmth of a city hotel, fueled by social media clues and fragile hope. But as the rain turns to blinding snow and the road vanishes into white nothingness, hope shatters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reach the cabin only to find your escape sabotaged: the battery is gone, the tires are missing. You are no longer the seeker; you are the next target for a frozen collection. To break the cycle, you must face the stalker who watches from the pine tree shadows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seen through an immersive first-person view, the core experience focuses on survival, heat management, and stealth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal Survival.<\/strong> The cold is your primary enemy. Manage your body heat by scavenging firewood and keeping the hearth alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Stalker AI.<\/strong> The Ice, a mysterious and terrifying cowboy, is no scripted jumpscare. He observes, stalks, and hunts dynamically based on your noise and movement.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles.<\/strong> Scavenge for vehicle parts to make your escape while navigating psychological traps and deciphering chilling audio logs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/2db0e4684ed2007df1675da0e17d2c61.avif?t=1793718039\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras_big\/2db0e4684ed2007df1675da0e17d2c61.avif?t=1793718039 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Atmospheric Terror:<\/strong> The vast, suffocating scale of the snowy wilderness contrasted with the claustrophobic dread of a cabin hiding dark secrets.<\/li><li><strong>Body Heat Mechanics:<\/strong> Feel the frost. As your temperature drops, your vision blurs, your movement falters, and the world turns into a lethal hallucination.<\/li><li><strong>The Frozen Gallery:<\/strong> Uncover the tragic fate of the Frozen Lover, a symbolic narrative exploring obsession and eternal preservation.<\/li><li><strong>Immersive 3D Audio:<\/strong> High-quality sound design where every creaking floorboard or whisper of wind serves as your only warning. Headphones recommended.<\/li><li><strong>A Concise Nightmare:<\/strong> A focused, story-driven horror experience designed to be finished in one sitting (approx. 2 hours), leaving a lingering chill.<\/li><li><strong>Gritty Western Aesthetics:<\/strong> A unique visual style combining the rugged edge of a dark Western with the cold, sterile beauty of an arctic grave.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fire is dying. The Ice is watching. Keep the hearth alive.<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/925f681deaf29f19caa32a1537bd0eee.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUT NOW<\/strong>  |  Single-player  |  About 2 hours  |  First-person psychological horror<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ice is Watching<\/strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience that plunges you into a desolate, frozen nightmare. You don't play as a hero. You play as a desperate woman driven by a single question: <i>Where is he?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracing your lover's last known location to a remote mountain cabin, the temperature drops and a chilling realization sets in: you are not alone. A looming figure known only as &quot;The Ice&quot; is here. And he's been expecting you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/ea2a7d63864d2a3ff8171b641efec5e4.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK THE CYCLE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in the artificial warmth of a city hotel, fueled by social media clues and fragile hope. But as the rain turns to blinding snow and the road vanishes into white nothingness, hope shatters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You reach the cabin only to find your escape sabotaged: the battery is gone, the tires are missing. You are no longer the seeker; you are the next target for a frozen collection. To break the cycle, you must face the stalker who watches from the pine tree shadows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/c567a44a18789c0ecf36d1857d60b817.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seen through an immersive first-person view, the core experience focuses on survival, heat management, and stealth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal Survival.<\/strong> The cold is your primary enemy. Manage your body heat by scavenging firewood and keeping the hearth alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/f875d3328a6ef66b753eb5013821cccd.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Stalker AI.<\/strong> The Ice, a mysterious and terrifying cowboy, is no scripted jumpscare. He observes, stalks, and hunts dynamically based on your noise and movement.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles.<\/strong> Scavenge for vehicle parts to make your escape while navigating psychological traps and deciphering chilling audio logs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/2db0e4684ed2007df1675da0e17d2c61.avif?t=1793718039\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras_big\/2db0e4684ed2007df1675da0e17d2c61.avif?t=1793718039 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Atmospheric Terror:<\/strong> The vast, suffocating scale of the snowy wilderness contrasted with the claustrophobic dread of a cabin hiding dark secrets.<\/li><li><strong>Body Heat Mechanics:<\/strong> Feel the frost. As your temperature drops, your vision blurs, your movement falters, and the world turns into a lethal hallucination.<\/li><li><strong>The Frozen Gallery:<\/strong> Uncover the tragic fate of the Frozen Lover, a symbolic narrative exploring obsession and eternal preservation.<\/li><li><strong>Immersive 3D Audio:<\/strong> High-quality sound design where every creaking floorboard or whisper of wind serves as your only warning. Headphones recommended.<\/li><li><strong>A Concise Nightmare:<\/strong> A focused, story-driven horror experience designed to be finished in one sitting (approx. 2 hours), leaving a lingering chill.<\/li><li><strong>Gritty Western Aesthetics:<\/strong> A unique visual style combining the rugged edge of a dark Western with the cold, sterile beauty of an arctic grave.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.poster.avif?t=1793718039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.webm?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/extras\/4920fe0fe6fdf6f461cfaadf000ccfce.mp4?t=1793718039\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fire is dying. The Ice is watching. Keep the hearth alive.<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"One last GPS pin. One final hope. Following a GPS pin to the cabin, she thought she was coming for a rescue. She didn't know she was stepping into a frozen trap. Stranded and hunted by 'The Ice', you must keep the fire alive to survive the night. Uncover the chilling truth before you become his art","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/df870ad258aade18e147e6ff0e848dfdac94a38a\/header.jpg?t=1793718039","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/47ab82360eca61f7713dec7e207f624bb12c071c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793718039","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4367760\/47ab82360eca61f7713dec7e207f624bb12c071c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793718039","website":"https:\/\/casayonastudio.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760<br><\/l